      "action_id": "attach_defibrillator_pads",
      "timestamp_minutes": 15.0,
      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "Mandatory action per ACLS protocol: attach defibrillator pads to identify cardiac rhythm (VF/pVT vs asystole/PEA), which determines the next treatment pathway (defibrillation vs epinephrine). Must be completed within 60-minute deadline."
    },
    {
